          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: A witness noticed on one of his photos a bright point in the sky. No direct observation of this point was made at the time the photo was taken. No other witness accounts of observing the phenomenon have been reported. The vertical streak is very likely a photo artifact and processing within the device: the original photo 5512 had already undergone significant processing within the device (increased sharpness and high compression rate);  la photo nommée 2009-06-01-Hurbache-01.JPG appears to be an enlarged version where defects are amplified. The bright point could be a reflection of sunlight off an airplane, satellite, or balloon. The GEIPAN classifies this case as B.",
